      "title": "H3 Optimizations advanced example",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## H3 Optimizations — Advanced example\n\nFlattened version of ComfyUI's stock MiniMax H3 workflow so the optimization path is visible.\n\nH3 settings in this example:\n- H3 Memory Optimization: production defaults\n- Video attention budget: 15%\n- Early: 4 steps at 50%\n- Late: disabled\n- Sparse backend: Kitchen INT8 (explicit Advanced-node default)\n\nThe H3 nodes sit after the normal model/Lightning-LoRA switch and feed both the scheduler and guider."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
